    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Bridge WP form builder plugins to any backend over HTTP requests.</p>\n<h3>Integrations</h3>\n<p>Forms Bridge has integrations for <a href=\"https://www.gravityforms.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">GravityForms</a>, <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/contact-form-7/\" rel=\"ugc\">Contact Form 7</a>, <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/wpforms-lite/\" rel=\"ugc\">WP Forms Lite</a> and <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/ninja-forms/\" rel=\"ugc\">Ninja Forms</a>.</p>\n<h3>Addons</h3>\n<p>Forms Bridge has core support for REST API connexions and addons for <a href=\"https://www.odoo.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Odoo</a> and <a href=\"https://workspace.google.com/products/sheets/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Google Spreadsheets</a>.</p>\n<h3>Docs</h3>\n<p>See the official plugin&#8217;s documentation in our <a href=\"https://git.coopdevs.org/codeccoop/wp/plugins/forms-bridge/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">gitlab repository</a>.</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Bridge WP form builder plugins to any backend over HTTP requests.",
